id: university-content-sync
name: University content stays in sync with Paradigm features
description: >-
  When modifying Paradigm features, check if university lessons or PLSAT questions need updating. Lessons and question
  groups are mapped to concept symbols via .purpose files in packages/university/src/content/courses/.purpose and
  packages/university/src/content/plsat/.purpose. Run paradigm_ripple on affected symbols to find impacted course
  content.
category: documentation
trigger: postflight
severity: warn
check:
  type: file-modified
  params:
    patterns:
      - packages/university/src/content/courses/.purpose
      - packages/university/src/content/plsat/.purpose
enabled: true
